; Medium Network - SYNTHETIC sample network for FlowAnalyzer (demonstration only).
; Laid along the streets of the town centre of Tiradentes, Minas Gerais, Brazil, but it is NOT
; the real water system: sources, pipes, diameters, demands and patterns are invented; no real assets.
; Coordinates: WGS 84 / UTM zone 23S (EPSG:32723), metres.
; Street layout © OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL 1.0, https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/ - https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright
; Source database: https://github.com/transparentbluewater/flowanalyzer-sample-networks
; This sample is available under the ODbL 1.0 at https://github.com/transparentbluewater/flowanalyzer-sample-networks
; Ground levels approximate (SRTM 30 m).
; P1 (gravity main, no junctions on it) crosses a dip at ~932 m: static pressure ~82 m there; choose its pipe class for that.
; Generated by tool/generate_tiradentes_sample.dart.

